# Raw Inside Airbnb exports. These are hundreds of megabytes and exceed
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, so they are never committed. Download them
# separately and place them here; R/01-prepare-data.R reduces listings.csv to
# the small data/ratings.csv that everything else reads.
listings.csv
reviews.csv

# Derived data and cached posteriors -- all regenerable by running the pipeline
data/
.cache/
outputs/*/fits/

# LaTeX build artefacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
